  "notes": "Used for both publishing printed materials and issuing official documents.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {発行|はっこう}⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧ (to publish, issue)\n- {発行|はっこう}{部数|ぶすう} (circulation, print run)\n- {発行|はっこう}{日|び} (publication date, issue date)\n- {発行|はっこう}{者|しゃ} (publisher, issuer)\n- {発行|はっこう}{元|もと} (issuing authority)\n- ⟦クレジットカード→クレジットカード：06968_kurejittokaado⟧⟦の→の：09472_no⟧{発行|はっこう} (credit card issuance)\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- ⟦{出版|しゅっぱん}→出版：03222_shuppan⟧ (publishing — specifically for books)",
